{"title":"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Nine copies of a certain pamphlet cost less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/4/e243694a067a4505a174c349418e98efd227d576.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$ 10.00$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" /> while ten copies of the same pamphlet (at the same price) cost more than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/3/38303858a69ce7df408b54e77ba9cdd471780eb0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$ 11.00$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" />.  How much does one copy of this pamphlet cost?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/5/ec5bdc2c0e59651ee5e6fa74ba318dc73d744feb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"24\" height=\"17\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/7/3c7fbd99eb0ea88bd3e8d4b78d9fec4cfd87166e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$1.07$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"41\" height=\"14\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/2/5e226c2f5a445f0a9ab589c1337336ea7587b36e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(B)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"23\" height=\"17\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/5/d35136c6837f07d2366bfc8cbfab76a33e612bf9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$1.08$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/8/988a15926640244e366e55b6e468af2e3e60047e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(C)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"23\" height=\"17\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/b/36b7b6fe5e5a692c29bc8f2fc37e82e6220209d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$1.09$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/d/87d32bac8c5abe4d6b299d444f24a8055279b232.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"24\" height=\"17\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/2/72209f7b2519c856d8ce62d939d3621da1a4e23a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$1.10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/3/fb3626ff02d0ba34a6ae1421f4b5e155992ec4cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(E)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"23\" height=\"17\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/0/5c0f8d54fb45a8747a913ca099210039bc99142a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$1.11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> be the cost of one pamphlet in dollars. The first restriction implies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/6/4b672cb4c465897b5b356382841dbf1eab11b965.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9p&lt;10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"17\" />, that is, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/a/85a22833200689e0ac6306ab03b8054ec3a5a8b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p&lt;1.1111...$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"101\" height=\"17\" />, while the section restriction implies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/f/66fc4928b6429ae54f23e7ace87161ad4b133d30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10p&gt;11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"72\" height=\"17\" />, that is, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/5/b85d39a8977f1450e89b7b48b048cdb75c990ca2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p&gt;1.10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"17\" />.  Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/2/dd25b23a793f4552d56b4874cc3586d070ed3aea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.10 &lt; p &lt; 1.1111...$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"157\" height=\"17\" />, and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/4/b94d429f92e31feb27b431e4d34410a2e1ea6d9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\$1.11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"121\" height=\"31\" />, since the price must be a whole number of cents.\n</p><p>Note: the second restriction alone eliminates all the incorrect answer choices.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/zMt-JeI-KhA\">https://youtu.be/zMt-JeI-KhA</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME\" title=\"1985 AJHSME\">1985 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1985\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan